        "created_at": "2016-03-04T23:12:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't see how that implies they could be used for the Sentinels deck, sorry. It's a reach to conclude that. They'd be designed around having their own character cards and decks, rather than designed around being used in the Sentinels deck. They'd have too much health, for one thing, and their powers wouldn't be designed around the Sentinels deck. I just don't see it.</p>",
