        "id": 163730,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-06T01:30:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>From the 2/12 chat</p><p>\n&gt; </p><p><span>sonvar</span><span>:</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>@</span><span>gtgchristopher</span><span>&nbsp;Will the new Void Guard Sentinels have new hero names?</span></p><div><p><span>GTGChristopher</span><span>:</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>@</span><span>Sonvar</span><span>&nbsp;No. They will be Doctor Medico, Mainstay, The Idealist, and Writhe</span></p></div><p><span>nosirragessej</span><span>:</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>How are the Void Guard characters going to effect being on a team with The Sentinels? Are they getting new names to avoid weird interactions with each others' decks?</span></p><p><span>GTGChristopher</span><span>:</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>@</span><span>Nosirragessej</span><span>&nbsp;There will be rules included in the Void Guard box explaining how to deal with precisely that!</span></p><p><span>\n</span></p><p>So there are some issues he expects that he will have to address with their hero pack. &nbsp;</p>",
